  m_Name: HierophantCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  Name: The Hierophant
  text: "The card stands solemn in your hand, a symbol of authority, law, and unquestioned
    order.  $Its presence is heavy, commanding obedience and adherence to tradition. 
    $You feel the Hand of the King in its weight\u2014stern, unyielding, and intolerant
    of delay or disobedience.  $Every instruction, every glance, carries the authority
    of the realm.  $The Hierophant reminds you that some powers demand respect and
    compliance, and that rules govern even the smallest actions in the kingdom."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8b9d5a8b9f42363f2b91ef1e9f018745, type: 3}
